    <section class="py-16 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" style="background: var(--tn-bg-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center" data-gsap="fade-up"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4 tracking-tight" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">Criado pela Coachie AI</h2><p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--tn-text-secondary);">O TranslateNow é desenvolvido pela Coachie AI, um estúdio de desenvolvimento mobile especializado em aplicativos iOS e Android com IA. Nossa equipe publicou vários apps na App Store e Google Play, combinando Machine Learning no dispositivo, serviços de IA em nuvem (OpenAI GPT-4o, ElevenLabs) e integração profunda com a plataforma (ARKit, Siri, WidgetKit, Live Activities, Jetpack Compose, ML Kit) para construir ferramentas que resolvem desafios reais de comunicação.</p><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Dúvidas ou parcerias? Entre em contato pelo <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-soft-coral);">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a></p></div></section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="py-24 sm:py-32 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden" id="download" style="background: var(--tn-bg-primary);" data-gsap-final-cta><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[700px] pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,107,74,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);" data-gsap-cta-glow></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,107,74,0.2), transparent);"></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto relative z-10"><Image src={translateIcon} alt="Ícone do app TranslateNow" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl mx-auto mb-8" style="box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(255,107,74,0.2), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);" width={192} height={192} data-gsap-cta-icon /><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-5 leading-tight tracking-tight" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">Comece a falar qualquer idioma hoje</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg mb-10 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tn-text-secondary);">Baixe o TranslateNow grátis na App Store. Clonagem de voz, tradução AR, documentos, ferramentas de escrita, offline e 135+ idiomas.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4" data-gsap-cta-btn><a href={APP_STORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="tn-coral-btn tn-coral-btn-large">Baixar Grátis<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg></a></div></div></section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="py-10 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" style="background: var(--tn-bg-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);" data-gsap-footer><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-center md:text-left"><a href="/translate-now" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 no-underline group"><Image src={translateIcon} alt="Ícone TranslateNow" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl object-cover" style="box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" width={96} height={96} /><div><span class="font-bold text-sm block" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">TranslateNow</span><span class="text-xs" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">por Coachie AI</span></div></a><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs flex-wrap justify-center" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);"><a href={PRIVACY_URL} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Política de Privacidade</a><span style="color: var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);">·</span><a href={TERMS_URL} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Termos de Uso</a><span style="color: var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);">·</span><a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Support</a>{LANGUAGE_LINKS.map((link) => (<><span style="color: var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);">·</span><a href={link.href} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">{link.label}</a></>))}</div><div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-end gap-1"><a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="text-xs hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--tn-text-hint);">Última atualização: março de 2026</span></div></div></footer>
  </main>

  <!-- FAQ Override -->
  <style is:inline>
    .tn-faq-content { height: auto !important; max-height: 0 !important; overflow: hidden !important; transition: max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), opacity 0.3s ease !important; opacity: 0 !important; }
    .tn-faq-item.faq-active .tn-faq-content { max-height: 2000px !important; opacity: 1 !important; }
    .tn-faq-item.faq-active .tn-faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  </style>
  <script is:inline>
    window.addEventListener('load', function() {
      document.querySelectorAll('.tn-faq-content').forEach(function(c) { c.style.removeProperty('height'); c.style.removeProperty('overflow'); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.tn-faq-btn').forEach(function(oldBtn) {
        var newBtn = oldBtn.cloneNode(true); oldBtn.parentNode.replaceChild(newBtn, oldBtn);
        newBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
          e.preventDefault(); e.stopPropagation();
          var item = newBtn.closest('.tn-faq-item'); if (!item) return;
          var wasActive = item.classList.contains('faq-active');
          document.querySelectorAll('.tn-faq-item').forEach(function(el) { el.classList.remove('faq-active', 'open', 'is-open'); var content = el.querySelector('.tn-faq-content'); if (content) { content.style.removeProperty('height'); content.style.removeProperty('overflow'); } });
          if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('faq-active');
        });
      });
    });
  </script>
</TranslateNowLayout>